# each mnemonic: class, parameter (digit, opcode or condition), operand size, extra
fn xamna -> u32x520
t arr 1 0 32 0 1 0 64 0 1 1 32 0 1 1 64 0 1 4 32 0 1 4 64 0 1 5 32 0 1 5 64 0 1 6 32 0 1 6 64 0 1 7 32 0 1 7 64 0 2 0 32 0 2 0 64 0 2 0 8 0 3 0 32 0 3 0 64 0 3 0 8 0 4 0 64 0 5 0 32 0 6 0 32 0 6 0 64 0 7 0 32 0 7 0 64 0 8 3 32 0 8 3 64 0 8 4 32 0 8 4 64 0 8 6 32 0 8 6 64 0 9 0 32 0 9 0 64 0 9 1 32 0 9 1 64 0 10 0 32 0 10 0 64 0 10 1 32 0 10 1 64 0 10 4 32 0 10 4 64 0 10 5 32 0 10 5 64 0 10 7 32 0 10 7 64 0 11 80 64 0 11 88 64 0 12 195 0 0 12 1295 0 0 13 233 0 0 13 232 0 0 14 0 0 0 14 1 0 0 14 2 0 0 14 3 0 0 14 4 0 0 14 5 0 0 14 6 0 0 14 7 0 0 14 8 0 0 14 9 0 0 14 10 0 0 14 11 0 0 14 12 0 0 14 13 0 0 14 14 0 0 14 15 0 0 15 0 8 0 15 1 8 0 15 2 8 0 15 3 8 0 15 4 8 0 15 5 8 0 15 6 8 0 15 7 8 0 15 8 8 0 15 9 8 0 15 10 8 0 15 11 8 0 15 12 8 0 15 13 8 0 15 14 8 0 15 15 8 0 16 0 32 0 16 0 64 0 16 1 32 0 16 1 64 0 16 2 32 0 16 2 64 0 16 3 32 0 16 3 64 0 16 4 32 0 16 4 64 0 16 5 32 0 16 5 64 0 16 6 32 0 16 6 64 0 16 7 32 0 16 7 64 0 16 8 32 0 16 8 64 0 16 9 32 0 16 9 64 0 16 10 32 0 16 10 64 0 16 11 32 0 16 11 64 0 16 12 32 0 16 12 64 0 16 13 32 0 16 13 64 0 16 14 32 0 16 14 64 0 16 15 32 0 16 15 64 0 17 87 0 0 17 111 0 1 17 254 0 1 17 250 0 1 17 219 0 1 17 235 0 1 17 239 0 1 17 244 0 1 17 108 0 1 17 98 0 1 18 0 0 0 19 6 0 62066 19 2 0 53874 19 3 0 115 20 0 0 0 21 0 0 0
ret t
