nfd eq fd false
mk and ndup nfd
upd and ndup fd
s0 rec g1 ix
cn select mk 1 0
ns fold xalnew cn s0 p2 p3 p4 h 1 p5 p6
g2 at ns 0
ix2 at ns 1
cu select upd 1 0
g3 fold xadefset cu g2 ix2 p5
dor at g3 7
nd at g3 8
dor2 call xas8 dor nd ix2
nd1 add nd 1
dor3 select ndup dor2 dor
nd2 select ndup nd1 nd
g4 put g3 7 dor3
