ln0 at p0 19
nw at p0 2
bsz at p0 15
alld call xaall p2 p3 p4 0
nm call xanum p2 p3 p4
nov at nm 1
nlo at nm 3
nhi at nm 4
nh0 eq nhi 0
nov0 eq nov false
small and nh0 nov0
innote eq sec 2
intext eq sec 0
inbss eq sec 1
ntext eq intext false
big eq small false
e1 and alld ntext
e2 and alld big
e3 or e1 e2
e4 or e3 innote
